  "player_hint_1_en": "Suppose Alma were at row 8, column 4: then Cyril would have nowhere left to go. So Alma can't be there. Suppose Alma were at row 7, column 3: then Vince would have nowhere left to go. So Alma can't be there. Testing the remaining squares the same way rules out a few more. So Alma (A) must be at row 6, column 4. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "Suppose Erin were at row 5, column 2: then Gemma would have nowhere left to go. So Erin can't be there. So Erin (E) must be at row 8, column 1. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "Suppose Cyril were at row 4, column 7: then Gemma would have nowhere left to go. So Cyril can't be there. So Cyril (C) must be at row 4, column 8. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "Suppose Bonnie were at row 7, column 7: then Gemma's clue (\"She was exactly two rows south of Vince.\") could not be true. So Bonnie can't be there. So Bonnie (B) must be at row 7, column 5. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Fiona that fits her clue (\"She was beside the water.\"). So Fiona (F) must be at row 2, column 3. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Desmond that fits his clue (\"He was in the Frozen Lake, but not beside a boulder.\"). So Desmond (D) must be at row 1, column 6. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "Gemma's own clue (\"She was exactly two rows south of Vince.\") rules out more squares. So Gemma (G) must be at row 5, column 2. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Vince. So Vince (the victim) must be at row 3, column 7. Cross out his row and column. Cyril is the only person in the Car Park with Vince, so Cyril is the murderer!"
